tests/data/csp_v5.xdts

  A timesheet in the exact key order and layout that CLIP STUDIO PAINT EX
  writes, used here so that this crate's XDTS output can be checked against
  it byte for byte. The order and layout were read off a sheet the
  application exported; the contents are invented. No part of a production
  timesheet is reproduced here.
